.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]**Oni** are Japanese ogres with horned, demonic
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]faces and unearthly red or blue skin, said to carry
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]iron clubs and possess tremendous strength. Not
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]every oni is evil, but inviting one to tea to find out
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]may be unwise.
